  ('fp-g00942', 'forest-production', 'silvicultural-methods-systems', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'In the two-aged silvicultural system, how are different age cohorts maintained to ensure sustainable forest management?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"By clearcutting all trees and replanting a mixed-age stand."},{"id":"b","text":"By selectively harvesting mature cohorts while protecting young regeneration."},{"id":"c","text":"By consistently planting new seedlings each year without harvesting."},{"id":"d","text":"By thinning only the understory to allow for new growth."}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fp-g00943', 'forest-production', 'silvicultural-methods-systems', 'Hard', 'mock',
   'Which silvicultural method involves the use of a preparatory cut, establishment cut, and removal cut to create a new even-aged stand?',
